            <ArticleTitle>CETi-1. AVANT.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>334-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>CETi-1, a vaccine that stimulates antibodies specific for cholesteryl ester transfer protein, is under development by AVANT Immunotherapeutics for potential use in reducing risk factors for atherosclerosis. Phase II trials with CETi-1 in hypercholesterolemia and atherosclerosis had been initiated by August 2001.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
